      "releaseNotes": "ALREADY BOUGHT FOLLIE? NOTHING CHANGES.\nYour access is permanent. You will never be asked to pay again — no subscription, no trial, nothing to do. Update and carry on exactly as before.\n\nIN THIS UPDATE\n• Setting up Follie for the first time is quicker and clearer\n• Fixed a setup screen you could get stuck on, with no way forward\n• The subscription screen opens faster, and no longer reports a problem that isn't there\n\nNEW IN 2.0, IF YOU'RE COMING FROM AN EARLIER VERSION\nFollie Academy — board-style practice with exam-aligned tracks, full-length simulations, spaced repetition and a progress dashboard.\nClinical figures — capnograms, oxyhemoglobin dissociation curves, pressure-volume loops, ventilator scalars, arterial and central venous waveforms, and train-of-four.\nA clearer library — Tools is now the Library, History is now the Casebook, and search moved to the Home screen.\nComorbidity library — 1,300+ conditions in one browsable list with preop, intraop and postop guidance.\nAccessibility — reworked contrast across all three themes, larger tap targets throughout.\nFeedback — report a problem from nearly any screen.\n\nFollie is now listed as \"Follie: All-in-One Anesthesia\" — same app, same icon, easier to find.\nFound something wrong, or something missing? follie@heyattuned.com — we read every email.",
